    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "JUST\nLOK\nAROUND!\nThe airplane you are on is unique.\nWhile many airlines have Boeing 707's,\nthis one has been totally refurbished and has\nmany completely new features to give you\nthe most pleasurable ride in the air.\nThis aircraft was specially designed for\nthe long-distance domestic routes of TWA's\nexclusive Ambassador Service* But we also\nfly it on shorter routes, many times a day,\nwhich means you can often enjoy it even if\nyou're not on an Ambassador Service flight.\nNote: The back cover of this piece is also a \"Seat Occupied\" card\nPlease feel free to use it if you have to leave your seat.\n*Service mark owned exclusively by Trans World Airlines, Inc.",
      "PLACE CARD\nIf you wish to retain this seat when you leave the airplane temporarily at\nan intermediate stop, kindly place this side up on the cushion of your seat.\nSORRY...THIS SEAT IS\nOCCUPIED!\nOCCUPE/OCUPADO/OCCUPATO\nTWA\n2005.118.042\n11-71 4-5879\nPrinted in U.S.A.",
      "FIRST CLASS\nFootrest\nFirst Class Lounge\nine newiy decoratea rirst ulass lounge is just inside ine\nentrance door of the airplane. It's an ideal place for a\ngame or caras, business alscussion or just a private cnat.\nRecline and back support\ncontrols\nIncreased leg room\nOn the armrest, underneath the ash tray,\nare two buttons. Push the top button\nano vour seat rec nes o au ne\nlower button inflates the lumbar support\ndevice. Be sure to sit forward when\npushing the button to let it inflate, then\nThere is also a convenient upholstered\nfootrest just in front of you. And the\nmiddle armrest can be removed.\nFirst Class seat\nThe luxury of space. This was one of the chief considera-\ntions when we redesigned this First Class section. Your\nnew seat is wider, reclines farther, and provides more leg\nand shin room. We added an inflatable lumbar support\ndevice that shapes to the contour of your back, and\nwidened the armrest between seats. We even installed\nfewer seats, to give you more room between rows. And\nfewer seats means more hostess attention. Colors can do\na lot to lift a traveler's spirits. Our new interiors include\n24 different color combinations with motifs based on the\ngreat cities of the world which we serve.\nSERVICE ON THE GROUND\nCHECK-IN\nBaggage check-in at curbside\nContainerized Bagdade Handina Svstem\nPassenger Service Ambassador\nAmbassador Service\nOn our longer distance domestic routes, this aircraft is\nassigned to your gate to smooth the boarding process.\nIsed as part of our extremely popular Ambassador\n• Fine meals. If you're on a lunch or dinner flight, you\nService. It is \"a whole new way to fly\"-from the moment\nhave a choice of five entrees in First Class or three\nyou reach our front door until you pick up your baggage\nentrees in Coach, plus a selection of premium liquors\non arrival. This comprehensive service includes:\nwines and liqueurs. Nominal charge in Coach for\n• Curbside check-in. Our skycap checks vour luaaaae\nalconolic beverages.\nright at the curb. If you have your ticket, you proceed\n• Containerized baggage handling system. The fastest,\ndirectiv to the denarture lounae.\nsafest weatherproof system for handling luggage offered\n• A Passenger Service Ambassador specially trained and\nby any airline."
